  -> partial: no arm reached the confirmation bar. Best donor rate was 26.6% at ALL 84 (own=0.0%). These heads carry source-specific content -- the answer stopped being the row's own -- but do not reconstruct the donor's answer, so report it as 'carries identity', not 'sufficient'.

